Core/Jessie: If I… if one of them attacks someone and they die, what happens?
Core/Rose: The plants spread to the new body. They merge. Become stationary.
Core/Jessie: Stationary?
Core/Rose: Like a tree. Rooted in place. Still infected, but… no longer mobile.
Core/Jessie: So killing them doesn’t stop the infection.
Core/Rose: No. It just… relocates it.
Core/Jessie: That’s fucked.
Core/Rose: Yeah.